{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"像一连三次嘴硬说没事，越使劲强调，声音越发颤\",\"source\":\"第一次还有几分相信，第二次开始努力让自己相信，说到第三次，连反复说这句话本身都暴露出：其实还是很在意。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿区分了第一次尚有几分相信、第二次才开始努力相信的心理递进，屏幕稿把三次都概括成从一开始就在嘴硬，丢失了这一变化。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"像朝旷野远处呼喊，没得到任何回音，心愿仍悬在半空\",\"source\":\"歌唱又像向某个遥远、并不确定的对象祈求，愿望真切，音乐却没有许诺回应。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是说音乐没有许诺会得到回应，屏幕稿却写成已经没有得到任何回应，把结果未定变成了确定落空。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b706fb4a-55d7-4273-a7c6-26e29eefbd37", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T224625194714Z", "elapsed_seconds": 167.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T22:49:12.685222+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eed3c5a077ad321661a3e7d44976d097e967dfa7132cf778aad3caf654803e02", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool